{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iuXD4Cef2F1794554630.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受天氣影響，香港管弦樂團原定今晚，在中環舉行的戶外音樂會要改期。</p><p></p><p>香港管弦樂團在社交平台宣布，由於天文台預測今晚有驟雨及狂風雷暴，原訂晚上在中環海濱舉行的「港樂．星夜．交響曲」戶外音樂會，將延期至明晚7時半舉行，觀眾可憑原有門票入場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.691660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:03.317476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:51.385085+00:00","content_hash":"74d9ccb9de4b978331abb81a807be1249d85da691d52efceaaad1a7731b8763d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.691660+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}